diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b5fe1b2a4feac926b16f4b55fd72f2bb6eb7b711..9e8ad7dcd4f1e569c54c6df8d12be7d99fd14f6f 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,22 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()`, exported from `src/index.ts`, keeps the rental of boards and sails in memory:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` registers an item; `kind` is `'board'` or `'sail'`, and
+  `dailyPrice` is the price of one day in integer euro cents.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns the total for the period.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` books the item for the period and returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`.
+
+Periods are whole days: `start` and `end` are ISO-8601 UTC midnights, and `end` is the start of the day after
+the last day. An item cannot be booked for overlapping periods. Cancellations are not implemented yet.
+
+## Build and test
+
+```
+npm run build   # compile src/ to dist/
+npm test        # compile, then run the tests in dist/
+```
